WEBVTT

00:21:28.538 --> 00:21:30.996
it's almost always a better thing

00:21:30.996 --> 00:21:33.663
because there's nothing wrong
with kicking the tires

00:21:33.663 --> 00:21:35.663
and interrogating something.

00:21:36.246 --> 00:21:39.871
But the best thing and this
is what I found, you know,

00:21:40.038 --> 00:21:45.538
recently I co-wrote a pilot with
a writer named Latoya Morgan,

00:21:45.538 --> 00:21:47.788
and she's a wonderful writer.

00:21:47.788 --> 00:21:51.204
She's a black woman who brings a point
of view that is clearly going to be

00:21:51.621 --> 00:21:53.246
a life experience, very
different from mine.

00:21:53.704 --> 00:21:58.954
And when I bring up an idea and
she says, you know, hold on,

00:21:59.371 --> 00:22:01.746
let's talk about this or
that or vice versa,